    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cDissecting Love\u201d is an autopsy of a queer relationship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using various tools to dissect the couple's fused bodies, you find out their story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of their arguments and the relationship's ultimate end are shaped by how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.poster.avif?t=1731701028\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.webm?t=1731701028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.mp4?t=1731701028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dissecting Love&quot; is a narrative based, emotional exploration game. Discover the story and it's multiple endings as you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on queer issues, the game delves into the complexities of the characters relationship, addressing themes such as family dynamics, external pressures, and personal identity.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cDissecting Love\u201d is an autopsy of a queer relationship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using various tools to dissect the couple's fused bodies, you find out their story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of their arguments and the relationship's ultimate end are shaped by how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.poster.avif?t=1731701028\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.webm?t=1731701028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816500/extras/6e57a5bb287ee0630054dfe6b9415439.mp4?t=1731701028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dissecting Love&quot; is a narrative based, emotional exploration game. Discover the story and it's multiple endings as you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on queer issues, the game delves into the complexities of the characters relationship, addressing themes such as family dynamics, external pressures, and personal identity.</p>",
